{# Issue #63: warns the ISB that advisory sources are down — count and duration only.

   Deliberately carries NO provider name and NO error text. The link to /import-status appears
   only when the caller passes show_import_status_link (#299): that page is ROLE_ADMIN-only by a
   decision documented on ImportStatusController ("do not widen this gate"). The ISB owns the
   fachliche statement "my information gathering is incomplete" and gets no link; the admin owns
   the repair and is led straight to it.

   Deliberately NOT dismissible either. The trigger for this banner was a 74-day outage that
   stayed invisible although the auto-pause mail had gone out — a warning that can be clicked
   away repeats exactly that failure. It disappears when the sources are healthy again, not
   before.

   Variables:
   - source_health: \App\Import\ImportSourceHealth — never null here, the caller checks
   - show_import_status_link: bool — decided by the controller, mirrors the /import-status gate
#}
{% set broken_days = source_health.daysSinceOldestSuccess() %}
<div class="alert alert-warning mb-3" role="alert">
    <div class="d-flex">
        <div>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                 fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                 stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon alert-icon me-2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12 9v4"/>
                <path d="M10.363 3.591l-8.106 13.534a1.914 1.914 0 0 0 1.636 2.871h16.214a1.914 1.914 0 0 0 1.636 -2.87l-8.106 -13.536a1.914 1.914 0 0 0 -3.274 0z"/>
                <path d="M12 16h.01"/>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="alert-title h4">
                {{ 'dashboard.source_health.title'|trans({'%count%': source_health.disruptedCount}) }}
            </h2>
            <div class="text-secondary">
                {% if broken_days is null %}
                    {{ 'dashboard.source_health.body_never'|trans }}
                {% else %}
                    {{ 'dashboard.source_health.body_since'|trans({'%days%': broken_days}) }}
                {% endif %}
            </div>
            {% if show_import_status_link %}
                <div class="mt-2">
                    <a href="{{ path('app_import_status') }}" class="alert-link">{{ 'dashboard.source_health.link'|trans }}</a>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
